<title>USA: ADM Cocoa president retiring in September.</title>
<headline>ADM Cocoa president retiring in September.</headline>
<dateline>DECATUR, Ill. 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Archer Daniels Midland Co said Wednesday Wim van Bergen, president of ADM Cocoa, plans to retire from ADM as of September 15.</p>
<p>In the interim, Hans Leijdekker, senior vice president, will assist van Bergen in managing ADM Cocoa, ADM said.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
